  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the introduction of the Mirror 2.0 addons, including Face Mirror, FBT Mirror, and Immersive Mirror, I've found that the spheres used to represent trackers tend to disappear when looking into a normal mirror.\nThis is fixed by toggling FBT Mirror, but then will duplicate the avatar and the trackers in both mirrors at the same time. I feel that the toggle should be increased, so that the tracker pucks are able to be toggled on and off, without having to toggle a secondary mirror for FBT recalibration.",
